WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.532
Everyone drove along the road.

2
00:00:08.532 --> 00:00:11.038
"Hmm," Eddy thought.

3
00:00:11.038 --> 00:00:23.662
"Who's going to say good-bye?"

4
00:00:23.662 --> 00:00:28.513
"We're here," Ms. Fender said.

5
00:00:28.514 --> 00:00:37.077
"The Tire Town Spaceport.

6
00:00:37.077 --> 00:00:54.255
Please follow the rules."

7
00:00:54.255 --> 00:01:05.977
Everyone gasped.

8
00:01:05.977 --> 00:01:10.246
"I see a rocket!" Jeb said.

9
00:01:10.246 --> 00:01:15.941
"His name is Rocky," Ms. Fender said.

10
00:01:15.941 --> 00:01:19.791
"He's going to space.

11
00:01:19.791 --> 00:01:23.119
We'll watch him blast off!"

12
00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:25.825
"Whoa," Dipper said.

13
00:01:25.825 --> 00:01:32.472
"Space is so cool," Poppy said.

14
00:01:32.473 --> 00:01:35.829
Gasser stared at Rocky.

15
00:01:35.829 --> 00:01:37.957
His eyes were big.

16
00:01:37.957 --> 00:01:42.799
"I never saw a rocket before!"

17
00:01:42.799 --> 00:01:45.500
"Me neither," Eddy said.

18
00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:48.587
"Rockets are so fast!"

19
00:01:48.587 --> 00:01:51.207
"Ms. Fender!" Gasser called.

20
00:01:51.207 --> 00:01:55.632
"Can we meet Rocky?"

21
00:01:55.633 --> 00:01:59.859
"Yes," Ms. Fender said.

22
00:01:59.859 --> 00:02:03.362
"We're going to meet him now."

23
00:02:03.362 --> 00:02:06.015
"Cool," Eddy said.

24
00:02:06.015 --> 00:02:09.581
"I can't wait to meet Rocky."

25
00:02:09.582 --> 00:02:14.112
Zippy laughed.

26
00:02:14.112 --> 00:02:17.538
"You're slow!" he said.

27
00:02:17.538 --> 00:02:23.861
"Rocky won't want to meet you!"

